Axi-Theme attribution
=====================

This repository includes the upstream Axi-Theme source at commit
`c6470e7308bad839489932601e2be08f9b542e70`:

<https://github.com/Axi404/Axi-Theme>

The upstream source is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The
complete license text is preserved in `Axi-Theme.Apache-2.0.txt`.

Local modifications in this repository are limited to:

* replacing the upstream author, title, description, avatar, favicon, domain,
  links, blog content, academic profile, publications, projects, education,
  awards, and statistics with Jinhui Luo's information;
* configuring the upstream Astro integration for GitHub Pages and the
  `jinhui524.github.io` domain;
* removing Axi demo-only personal assets, sponsorship content, analytics,
  comments, and friend-circle services; and
* updating README, VSCode recommendations, deployment workflow, and GitHub
  Pages documentation for this repository.

The repository's existing MIT license remains in `LICENSE` for the original
project material. The Apache-2.0 terms continue to apply to the upstream
Axi-Theme portions.
